<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Nu Skin dazzles on NYSE.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Nu Skin dazzles on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc NUS.N shares on Friday rose almost 30 percent in the company's market debut on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company is the exclusive Asian distributor of Nu Skin International Inc personal products including cosmetics, skin creams, shampoo and hairbrushes, as well as nutritional supplements for weight management and sports nutrition.</p>
<p>Its shares rose as much as 6-3/4 to 29-3/4 in early afternoon trading before settling down to 29-1/4 at 1400 EST/1900 GMT. Volume was more than 6.0 million shares.</p>
